        <T en="One monorepo, cleanly layered." it="Un monorepo, a strati puliti." />
      </h2>
      <T
        en="A shared engine at the bottom, client skins in the middle, a governance console on top, a backend for auth and sharing. Between engine and skins sits the build chain: the Factory’s own scripts on one side, the Adobe APIs they call on the other."
        it="Un motore condiviso alla base, le skin cliente al centro, una console di governance in cima, un backend per auth e condivisione. Fra motore e skin sta la catena di build: da un lato gli script della Factory, dall’altro le API Adobe che chiamano."
        as="p" class="lead prose-max" data-reveal />

      <div class="arch-diagram" data-reveal role="img"
           aria-label={`Architecture: console and backend on top, ${EXPERIENCE_COUNT} client skins in the middle, shared core engine at the base, delivered to GitHub Pages.`}>
        <div class="arch-layer arch-top">
          <div class="arch-box arch-box--console">
            <span class="arch-kicker">apps/console</span>
            <strong><T en="Super Admin Console" it="Super Admin Console" /></strong>
            <em><T en="auth · users · experiences registry" it="auth · utenti · registry esperienze" /></em>
          </div>
          <div class="arch-box arch-box--backend">
            <span class="arch-kicker">supabase</span>
            <strong>Backend</strong>
            <em><T en="Auth · Postgres/RLS · Edge Function" it="Auth · Postgres/RLS · Edge Function" /></em>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Due colonne, non una: brand:tokens, audit:deck, loop:seamless e sharp
             sono script della Factory. Metterli sotto «API Adobe» gonfiava il
             perimetro di cosa è Adobe nella catena. -->
        <div class="arch-layer arch-build">
          <span class="arch-layer-label"><T en="Build chain" it="Catena di build" /></span>
          <div class="arch-build-cols">
            <div class="arch-build-col">
              <p class="arch-build-col-h"><T en="Factory scripts" it="Script della Factory" /></p>
              <div class="arch-build-step">
                <code>brand:tokens</code>
                <span><T en="reads the client's design system from their production CSS" it="legge il design system del cliente dal suo CSS di produzione" /></span>
              </div>
              <div class="arch-build-step">
                <code>assets:build</code>
                <span><T en="Firefly Image or Pexels stock, from a typed manifest, with provenance" it="Firefly Image o stock Pexels, da un manifest tipizzato, con provenance" /></span>
              </div>
              <div class="arch-build-step">
                <code>loop:seamless</code>
                <span><T en="re-cuts a clip so the wrap does not show, and measures it" it="ricuce una clip perché il giro non si veda, e lo misura" /></span>
              </div>
              <div class="arch-build-step">
                <code>audit:deck</code>
                <span><T en="the twelve-check gate, at three projection sizes" it="il gate a dodici check, su tre risoluzioni di proiezione" /></span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="arch-build-col">
              <p class="arch-build-col-h"><T en="Adobe APIs" it="API Adobe" /></p>
              <div class="arch-build-step arch-build-step--api">
                <code>/v3/images/generate</code>
                <span>Firefly Image — <T en="backdrops and scenes" it="sfondi e scene" /></span>
              </div>
              <div class="arch-build-step arch-build-step--api">
                <code>/v3/videos/generate</code>
                <span>Firefly Video — <T en="cover and closing clips" it="clip di copertina e chiusura" /></span>
              </div>
              <div class="arch-build-step arch-build-step--api">
                <code>ims/token/v3</code>
                <span>Adobe IMS — <T en="server-to-server auth" it="auth server-to-server" /></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="arch-build-out"><T en="tokens + assets + provenance ↓" it="token + asset + provenance ↓" /></span>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-layer arch-skins">
          <span class="arch-layer-label"><T en="Client skins — apps/*" it="Skin cliente — apps/*" /></span>
